# Density Compare
# Gold (Au) — real density 19.32 g/cm³. equal masses: Gold vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Gold Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 7.4mm material: gold at (-20mm, 3.7mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 154.1 g — the water cube is the reference
